Package: ggbipartite
Type: Package
Title: Visualize Bipartite Networks with ggplot2
Version: 0.10.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hidehito", "Okada", , "hidefungi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3210-2736"))
  )
Description: Provides tools to visualize bipartite interaction matrices with
    'ggplot2'. It computes reusable layouts for abundance ribbons or binary
    links, offers layers and a high-level plot composer, and aligns either
    network partition with a phylogenetic tree.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
